pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: left-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 110, 1100, 50]
  content:
    fontSize: 36
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>方向11：Memory encryption / integrity / replay</strong></p>
- elementId: subtitle
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 160, 1100, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      内存加密、完整性校验与重放保护
- elementId: intro
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 220, 1100, 70]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      避免把 access control、ownership、encryption、integrity、freshness/replay 混写。先用三篇主讲材料建立演进关系，再用证据等级控制每个结论。
- elementId: papers
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 300, 1100, 300]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.6
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>Memory Encryption: A Survey — 开创/基础入口（E2 / Background）</li>
      <li>Bonsai Merkle Trees — 代表性改进（E1 / Peer-reviewed）</li>
      <li>AMD SEV-SNP — 当前 SOTA/补充边界（E4 / Industry）</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
